---
import "../../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Privacy Policy - RiffRamp | Blind Pixels Studio</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for RiffRamp web app by Blind Pixels Studio." />
	</head>
	<body class="page">
		<Nav />
		<div class="layout">
			<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
				<header class="page-header">
					<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">RiffRamp</p>
				</header>

				<section class="content-section">
					<p class="last-updated">Last updated: March 31, {currentYear}</p>

					<h2>Overview</h2>
					<p>
						RiffRamp is a riff-practice web app focused on short musical passages, repetition quality,
						timing feedback, and measurable progress. We are committed to protecting your privacy and
						being transparent about how we handle your information.
					</p>

					<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
					<h3>Information You Provide</h3>
					<p>
						When you use RiffRamp, we may collect:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Practice data:</strong> Musical passages you select and your practice session history</li>
						<li><strong>Progress metrics:</strong> Timing accuracy, repetition counts, and skill progression data</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
					<p>
						We may automatically collect certain technical information to improve the service:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Usage data:</strong> How you interact with the app (pages visited, features used)</li>
						<li><strong>Device information:</strong> Browser type, operating system, and device type</li>
						<li><strong>Log data:</strong> IP address, access times, and error logs for troubleshooting</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
					<p>We use the collected information to:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Track your practice progress and provide timing feedback</li>
						<li>Improve the accuracy and quality of practice analysis</li>
						<li>Maintain and improve the functionality of the web app</li>
						<li>Troubleshoot technical issues and errors</li>
						<li>Understand usage patterns to enhance user experience</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p>
						RiffRamp may use third-party services for analytics and hosting. These services
						have their own privacy policies and data handling practices.
					</p>
					<p>
						We do not sell your personal information to third parties or use it for advertising purposes.
					</p>

					<h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>
					<p>
						Your practice data and usage information may be stored on our servers to provide the
						service and track your progress. We implement reasonable security measures to protect
						this information, including:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Encrypted data transmission (HTTPS)</li>
						<li>Secure server infrastructure</li>
						<li>Limited access to personal data by authorized personnel only</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						RiffRamp is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
						information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal
						information, please contact us so we can take appropriate action.
					</p>

					<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
					<p>
						If we make changes to this privacy policy, we will update the "Last updated" date at the
						top of this page.
					</p>

					<h2>Contact Us</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions about this privacy policy or RiffRamp, please contact us at:
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@blindpixelsstudio.com">support@blindpixelsstudio.com</a>
					</p>
				</section>
			</main>
		</div>
		<Footer />
	</body>
	<style lang="css">
		.layout {
			width: min(1080px, 100% - 3rem);
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 4rem 0 6.25rem;
		}

		.page-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 3rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
			background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f1f5ff, #93c5fd);
			-webkit-background-clip: text;
			-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			background-clip: text;
		}

		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			color: #93c5fd;
			margin: 0;
		}

		.content-section {
			background: rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.4);
			border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.1);
			border-radius: 1rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.last-updated {
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			margin-top: 0;
			font-style: italic;
		}

		.content-section h2 {
			color: #f1f5ff;
			font-size: 1.75rem;
			margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
		}

		.content-section h2:first-of-type {
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section h3 {
			color: #93c5fd;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
		}

		.content-section p {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section ul {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			padding-left: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section li {
			margin: 0.5rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section a {
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: underline;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.content-section a:hover,
		.content-section a:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.content-section strong {
			color: #f1f5ff;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			.page-header h1 {
				font-size: 2.25rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
			}

			.content-section {
				padding: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h2 {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h3 {
				font-size: 1.125rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</html>
